rrata/releases/assets/667040489","id":667040489,"node_id":"RA_kwDOVIon9c4nwjrp","name":"SHA256SUMS.txt","label":"","uploader":{"login":"anaxonda","id":15372684,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1MzcyNjg0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/15372684?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anaxonda","html_url":"https://github.com/anaxonda","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anaxonda/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anaxonda/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anaxonda/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anaxonda/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anaxonda/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anaxonda/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anaxonda/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anaxonda/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anaxonda/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"text/plain; charset=utf-8","state":"uploaded","size":651,"digest":"sha256:8262a56229d7900101c70963717dd5a7da84efb2ad26edef12c36192a2e6c825","download_count":0,"created_at":"2026-10-22T20:44:53Z","updated_at":"2026-10-22T20:44:53Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/anaxonda/burrata/releases/download/v0.1.7/SHA256SUMS.txt"}],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anaxonda/burrata/tarball/v0.1.7","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anaxonda/burrata/zipball/v0.1.7","body":"Playback diagnostics for troubleshooting intermittent playback failures, including reports from macOS.\n\n- Settings → Advanced → Playback diagnostics: enable logging, reproduce the problem, then export the JSON report before closing Burrata.\n- Reports include playback settings, helper versions, source and fallback decisions, cache activity, extraction failures, redirect status, and decoder startup timings. URLs, credentials and raw error text are excluded. Reports are saved locally and are not uploaded automatically.\n- Redirect responses no longer consume the generic alternate-format retry budget as though they were access-denied responses.\n\nThis release adds the evidence needed to investigate the intermittent Mac playback failures; it does not claim those failures are all resolved.\n\nDownloads: Apple Silicon macOS DMG, Windows x64 installer, Linux DEB/RPM/AppImage, and browser extensions. Checksums are provided in SHA256SUMS.\n\n[Supporting downloads, matching sources, licenses and build evidence](https://github.com/anaxonda/burrata/releases/tag/support-v0.1.7).\n"}